# doubled character
# was: 杀死匕伤岛上雷格那海盗前哨站站的首领
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:6
msgid "Kill the leader of the Regnan Pirate outpost at Dagger Wound."
msgstr "杀死匕伤岛上雷格那海盗前哨站的首领"

# doubled character
# was: 这个简单又高雅的戒指上面镶嵌有一枚鹅蛋大的的红宝石，切割精准，没有任何的缺陷。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:146
msgid "This simply elegant ring is set with a single, oval ruby of high quality - pigeon blood red, perfectly cut and clear of imperfections."
msgstr "这个简单又高雅的戒指上面镶嵌有一枚鹅蛋大的红宝石，切割精准，没有任何的缺陷。"

# doubled character
# was: 任务物品：这是艾瑞安·韩特交给你的信件，他要求你将信传递给雷格那岛上的的恐怖海盗史坦力。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:605
msgid "Quest Item: A letter given to you by Arion Hunter for delivery to the Dread Pirate Stanley on Regna."
msgstr "任务物品：这是艾瑞安·韩特交给你的信件，他要求你将信传递给雷格那岛上的恐怖海盗史坦力。"

# doubled character
# was: 在攻破了海盗前哨站站之后，我们终于安全了。
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_news.txt:15
msgid "With the Pirate Outpost defeated our homes are once again safe!  Thank you!"
msgstr "在攻破了海盗前哨站之后，我们终于安全了。"

